Inbox memorials inherit `:mm/Memory` plus type-specific required slots:

- **`suggested-type`** (required) — `observation` / `question` / `idea` / `bug` / `feedback` / `preference` / `decision` / `pattern` — one of the target types; names what structure to fill in
- **`importance`** — `low` / `medium` / `high` — helps review prioritize

